[model] lru_cache_ttl: A Thread-Safe LRU Cache with Time-To-Live (TTL) Expiry.
[model] 
[model] This module implements a robust, thread-safe Least Recently Used (LRU) cache
[model] that supports expiration of entries based on Time-To-Live (TTL) constraints.
[model] It is designed to be used in multi-threaded environments where concurrent
[model] access to the cache must be handled safely without external locking mechanisms.
