[model] - Uses a doubly-linked list for O(1) insertion and deletion, paired with
[model]   a Python dictionary for O(1) average-case lookups.
[model] - A background thread is used to periodically check for expired entries.
[model]   This approach minimizes lock contention during expiry checks.
[model] - A lock is held only during critical sections involving the underlying
[model]   data structures.
[model] 
